# Committed BEFORE any ablation_v1 label exists (contract K13). The queue chunks are exactly what
# the blind labellers see: case_id, borrower name, lender names, city, state -- nothing else. The key
# holds the strata, N_h, inclusion probabilities and repeat aliases and stays private. Committing every
# hash first proves the sample, the design weights and the repeat structure were fixed in advance.
# ablation_v1 is an INSTRUMENT EXPERIMENT, not a label source: it re-labels the pilot's own 200 cases
# under label_policy_v2 to test whether the brief was the problem. labelling.rounds_in_labels is
# [pilot_v1, main_v1], so these passes never enter labels.csv, are never adjudicated, and no founder
# review of this round exists or is planned.
